{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15303750","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15303750","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1530375001:1":{"text":"당연하죠. 지는 건 좋지 않으니까요.","source_cn":"当然，战败可不是什么好事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x961D8384CDA35A2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530375002:1":{"text":"그리고 루나애니들이 심은 밀이 자랐다면서요? 만약 저희가 전쟁에서 이겼다면 분명 그걸 전리품으로 손에 넣었을 거예요!","source_cn":"而且我还听说，兽人拿到的小麦能种出麦穗。要是我们打赢了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x143159518F8E8C90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530375003:1":{"text":"어휴, 너무 신경 쓰지 말아요. 적어도 지금 루나애니는 저희에게 식량을 나눠주고 있으니까요.","source_cn":"唉，别太在意，至少现在兽人答应会给我们分粮食。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0842A17D404C7274","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530375004:1":{"text":"배부르게 먹을 수 있고, 전쟁만 나지 않으면 전 만족해요.","source_cn":"只要能吃饱，别再打仗，我就心满意足了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF72A0AC74864B52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:乔治":{"text":"조지","source":"乔治","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:席博尔":{"text":"시보어","source":"席博尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}